  "Each morning before the world wakes, saffron-robed monks walk silently along the Bangkok Noi Canal to receive offerings of food from local residents — a ritual unchanged for centuries.": "每天清晨，在世界醒来之前，身披橙黄袈裟的僧侣沿曼谷诺依运河静默前行，接受当地居民的斋食供养——这一仪式数百年来未曾改变。",
  "Embark on a private boat journey along the historic Bangkoknoi Canal. Discover the city's hidden waterways as they were centuries ago, tailored for those who seek the extraordinary.": "登上私人游船，沿历史悠久的曼谷诺依运河启程。探寻数百年前模样依旧的城市隐秘水道，专为追寻非凡体验的您而设。",
  "Enquiry data may be processed by our reservations and guest-experience teams, and by trusted service providers who help us operate email and booking systems, under appropriate confidentiality obligations.": "您的咨询信息可能由我们的预订与宾客体验团队处理，亦可能由协助我们运营电子邮件与预订系统的可信服务商在相应保密义务下处理。",
  "Every W1 Ritual guest receives three treatment sessions included : one 90-minute session and two 60-minute sessions, any day of your stay. Spa open daily 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM.": "每位 W1 Ritual 宾客均含三次疗程：一次90分钟及两次60分钟，可在入住期间任意一天安排。水疗中心每日 9:00 – 21:00 开放。",
  "Every guest experience at W1 is a step in that repositioning. What matters most is that you feel the intention behind it — warmth, care, and a genuine sense of calm.": "在 W1，每一次宾客体验都是这场蜕变的一步。最重要的是，让您感受到其中的用心——温暖、关怀，与一份真切的宁静。",
  "Every journey includes a dedicated Boat Butler who shares the history and stories of both canal banks, serves chilled towels, water, tropical mocktails, and a curated snack box — ensuring your time on the water is as relaxing as it is enlightening. Life jackets, umbrellas, and audio equipment are provided as standard on all vessels.": "每段旅程均配有专属游船管家，为您讲述运河两岸的历史与故事，奉上冰镇毛巾、饮用水、热带无酒精特饮与精选点心盒——让您的水上时光既放松又充满启迪。所有船只均标配救生衣、遮阳伞与音频设备。",
  "Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom — from a cooling butterfly pea welcome tea to a plant-forward dinner, prepared with nutritional transparency and mindful intention. Food as a joyful, vital connection to place.": "每一餐、每一杯饮品都在礼赞泰国植萃与草本智慧——从清凉的蝶豆花迎宾茶到以植物为主的晚宴，皆以透明的营养理念与用心的意念烹制。美食，是与这片土地愉悦而鲜活的联结。",
  "Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom. Food at W1 is a joyful, vital connection to place — prepared with nutritional transparency and mindful intention.": "每一餐、每一杯饮品都在礼赞泰国植萃与草本智慧。在 W1，美食是与这片土地愉悦而鲜活的联结——以透明的营养理念与用心的意念烹制。",
  "Exclusive Buy-Out": "整院包场",
  "Exclusive resort buy-out · Private pool & pavilion · Full butler service": "度假村整体包场 · 私人泳池与凉亭 · 全程管家服务",
  "Executive Classic Cruise · Genesis 1": "行政经典游船 · Genesis 1",
  "Explore a vast network of canals where thousands of people go about their daily lives — just the other side of the Chao Phraya River. Our dedicated Boat Butler narrates the history of both canal banks while you enjoy tropical mocktails, local snacks, and the unhurried rhythm of the water.": "探索广阔的运河水网，感受数千居民的日常生活——就在湄南河的另一侧。专属游船管家为您讲述运河两岸的历史，您则尽享热带无酒精特饮、在地小食与水上悠然的节奏。",
  "Explore our canal-side herbal garden with our wellness botanist and blend your own personalised aromatic oils and herbal teas to take home.": "在健康植物专家的陪同下探索我们的运河畔草本花园，亲手调配专属的芳香精油与草本茶，带回家中。",
  "Explore the canalside community of Nonthaburi on two wheels. Our fat-tyre bikes are perfect for the flat canal paths — passing local markets, temple grounds, and riverside communities that give authentic insight into Bangkok's slower, quieter side.": "骑行探索暖武里的运河畔社区。我们的胖胎自行车非常适合平坦的运河小径——途经当地市集、寺庙庭院与河畔村落，带您真切感受曼谷更慢、更宁静的一面。",
