  "Fill in the form below and our team will respond within 2 hours during hotel hours (8 AM – 10 PM Bangkok time). For reservations, dining, or wellness bookings please use the dedicated links below.": "请填写下方表单，我们的团队将在酒店服务时间内（曼谷时间 8:00 – 22:00）2小时内回复。如需预订客房、餐饮或疗愈项目，请使用下方专属链接。",
