  "Flowing full-body massage with warm, botanically blended oils chosen for your goal — stress relief, calm, and more restful sleep. Jasmine, lemongrass, and kaffir lime melt tension while nourishing the skin.": "以温热的植萃复方精油进行的流畅全身按摩，依您的目标调配——舒缓压力、宁神静心、改善睡眠。茉莉、香茅与泰国青柠融化紧绷，同时滋养肌肤。",
