  "From Bangkok by Canal": "从曼谷经运河而来",
  "From giant slides and canal market visits to traditional Thai cooking classes and temple excursions — our concierge team can arrange bespoke experiences tailored to your interests.": "从巨型滑梯、运河市集探访，到泰式传统烹饪课与寺庙之旅——我们的礼宾团队可依您的兴趣安排专属体验。",
  "From high-profile corporate gatherings to elite social celebrations, we transform your vision into a flawlessly executed reality. Specialising in events for 50 to 200 guests, our resort blends sophisticated venues with impeccable service to deliver an unmatched event experience on the Bangkok Noi Canal.": "从高规格企业聚会到精英社交庆典，我们将您的愿景化为完美呈现的现实。我们专注于50至200位宾客的活动，以格调场地与无可挑剔的服务，在曼谷诺依运河畔呈献无与伦比的活动体验。",
  "From royal Thai tasting journeys and international fusion banquets to live cooking stations and wellness-focused menus — full bar service with signature cocktails and premium wines is included.": "从泰式皇家品鉴之旅、国际融合盛宴，到现场烹饪台与疗愈主题菜单——均含全套酒吧服务，包括招牌鸡尾酒与优质佳酿。",
  "From the first enquiry to the final dance, our Wedding Concierge team is with you at every step — ensuring an experience that is seamless, personal, and utterly unforgettable.": "从初次咨询到最后一支舞，我们的婚礼礼宾团队全程相伴——确保体验流畅贴心、专属于您、永生难忘。",
  "Full AV Support": "全套音视频支持",
