  "Gaeng Ranjuan Moo — Ancient Spicy & Sour Pork Soup": "Gaeng Ranjuan Moo — 古法酸辣猪肉汤",
  "Garden View": "花园景观",
  "Glide through Bangkok Noi's timeless waterways aboard a private luxury boat.": "乘私人豪华游船，滑行于曼谷诺依亘古如初的水道之上。",
  "Glide through the resort's open terraces and pathways on our surfskates — the perfect way to feel the flow of the canal beneath your feet without getting wet. Suitable for all ages and skill levels, with instruction available on request.": "踏上冲浪滑板，滑行于度假村开阔的露台与小径之间——无需下水，便能于足下感受运河的流动。适合所有年龄与水平，可预约教练指导。",
  "Grand Celebration Cruise · Genesis 2": "盛典庆祝游船 · Genesis 2",
  "Grand yet intimate, our air-conditioned main salon features teak and silk detailing, floor-to-ceiling windows framing the canal, and refined table settings worthy of any royal Thai occasion.": "盛大而不失亲密，我们的空调主厅以柚木与丝绸细节装点，落地窗框景运河，精致的餐桌陈设足以匹配任何泰式皇家场合。",
  "Greeted by name with a welcome ritual drink — butterfly pea tea or coconut flower elixir — followed by a relaxed 15-minute consultation to confirm your journey.": "以迎宾仪式饮品——蝶豆花茶或椰花甘露——亲切唤名相迎，随后进行轻松的15分钟咨询，确认您的旅程安排。",
  "Grounding and deeply soothing reflexology that works through the body's energy pathways via the feet — wonderful for circulation, tired legs, and a profound sense of restoration. A perfect arrival or evening ritual.": "沉稳而深度舒缓的足部反射疗法，经由双足调理全身能量通路——有益循环、缓解腿部疲惫，带来深层修复之感。是抵达之时或夜晚的完美仪式。",
