  "Host unforgettable celebrations in our private pavilions. Our chefs craft bespoke tasting menus incorporating seasonal canal-market produce or themed royal Thai banquets — tailored to every occasion.": "在我们的私人凉亭中举办难忘庆典。主厨可打造融合时令运河市集食材的定制品鉴菜单，或主题泰式皇家盛宴——为每个场合量身定制。",
  "Hours Breakfast 7:00–10:30 AM · All Day Menu Mon–Thu 7:00 AM–8:00 PM · Fri–Sun 7:00 AM–10:00 PM": "营业时间 早餐 7:00–10:30 · 全日菜单 周一至周四 7:00–20:00 · 周五至周日 7:00–22:00",
