  "Nestled along the historic Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, our dedicated Wedding Concierge team transforms your vision into reality — blending authentic Thai traditions with international standards of excellence, every detail curated with meticulous care.": "坐落于暖武里历史悠久的曼谷诺依运河畔，我们的专属婚礼礼宾团队将您的愿景化为现实——融合地道泰式传统与国际卓越标准，每个细节都以匠心精心策划。",
  "No two guests are the same. From the pre-arrival consultation onward, our Wellness Navigators listen, adapt and guide each itinerary to your own goals — deep sleep, renewed energy, or a simple mental reset.": "没有两位宾客是相同的。从抵达前咨询开始，我们的健康领航师便悉心聆听、灵活调整，依您的目标定制每段行程——深度睡眠、焕新能量，或只是一次心灵重启。",
