  "On-site floral designer specialising in Thai silk and lotus arrangements": "驻店花艺设计师，擅长泰丝与莲花艺术布置",
  "One of Thailand's most sacred daily rituals, Tak Bat takes place at dawn as saffron-robed monks walk the canal path to receive offerings of food from local residents. Our team will prepare your offering and guide you through this deeply moving and respectful ceremony.": "泰国最神圣的日常仪式之一——Tak Bat（清晨布施）于破晓时分举行，身披橙黄袈裟的僧侣沿运河小径前行，接受当地居民的斋食供养。我们的团队将为您备好供品，并引导您完成这场深深打动人心、庄重虔敬的仪式。",
  "Open-air dining under the stars with gentle breezes drifting from the Bangkok Noi Canal. Lantern-lit evenings and the soft sounds of the waterway create an atmosphere unlike anywhere else in Thailand.": "星空下的露天用餐，曼谷诺依运河的微风轻拂。灯笼映照的夜晚与水道的轻柔声响，营造出泰国独一无二的氛围。",
  "Our Fleet · W1 Vessels": "我们的船队 · W1 船只",
  "Our Signature Garden Queen rooms offer a serene retreat with warm Thai-modern interiors, thoughtfully appointed for couples and solo travellers seeking refined comfort surrounded by lush tropical gardens.": "尊尚花园大床房（Signature Garden Queen）以温暖的泰式现代内饰营造静谧居所，环绕于葱郁的热带花园之中，为追求精致舒适的情侣与独行旅客悉心打造。",
  "Our chefs at Thai Boran create bespoke wedding menus ranging from royal Thai tasting journeys to international fusion banquets — each one a reflection of the couple's palate and their guests' desires.": "Thai Boran 的主厨打造从泰式皇家品鉴之旅到国际融合盛宴的定制婚宴菜单——每一份都映照新人的味蕾与宾客的期待。",
  "Our concierge team will help you curate the perfect itinerary — from a sunrise paddle board session to a full-day boat journey through Bangkok's historic waterways.": "我们的礼宾团队将协助您策划完美行程——从日出桨板课程到穿越曼谷历史水道的全日游船之旅。",
  "Our dedicated Events Concierge team works closely with you at every stage — from initial brief to final bow. State-of-the-art audiovisual technology, bespoke catering by Thai Boran, and seamless logistics ensure every moment is executed with precision and elegance.": "我们的专属活动礼宾团队在每个阶段与您紧密合作——从最初的构想到最后的谢幕。顶尖的音视频技术、Thai Boran 的定制餐饮与流畅的后勤保障，确保每个瞬间都精准而优雅地呈现。",
  "Our menus and elixirs celebrate traditional Thai botanicals and are not intended to diagnose, treat, or cure any medical condition. All dietary requirements — vegan, gluten-free, dairy-free — are carefully accommodated.": "我们的菜单与焕活饮品礼赞泰国传统植萃，不用于诊断、治疗或治愈任何疾病。所有饮食需求——纯素、无麸质、无乳制品——均可悉心安排。",
  "Our most expansive room category, the Deluxe King Suite features a separate living area, lush tropical garden views and premium finishing throughout — an elevated experience for discerning guests.": "作为我们空间最为宽敞的房型，豪华特大床套房设有独立起居区、葱郁的热带花园景观与全屋高级装饰——为品味卓然的宾客带来更臻上乘的体验。",
  "Our most immersive offering — a complete life recalibration. Daily treatments, personalised nutrition, ancient and modern therapies, and bespoke wellness experiences.": "我们最深度的沉浸式体验——一场完整的生活重启。每日疗程、个性化营养、古法与现代疗法交融，以及专属定制的疗愈体验。",
  "Our team will prepare your offering of rice and traditional food, guide you through the correct protocol, and ensure this remains a respectful and deeply moving encounter with living Thai culture.": "我们的团队将为您备好米饭与传统食物供品，引导您遵循正确礼仪，确保这场与鲜活泰国文化的相遇始终庄重而动人。",
  "Outdoor Bathtub": "户外浴缸",
  "Outdoor Elegance": "户外雅致",
  "Outdoor Sala": "户外凉亭（Sala）",
  "Overlooking the serene Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, our signature restaurant and bar offer an intimate journey through Thai flavours. From royal palace recipes passed down through generations to innovative reinterpretations, every dish tells a story of Thailand's waterways, gardens, and vibrant culture.": "坐望暖武里静谧的曼谷诺依运河，我们的招牌餐厅与酒吧呈献一段亲密的泰式风味之旅。从世代相传的皇家宫廷食谱到创新演绎，每道菜肴都诉说着泰国水道、园林与鲜活文化的故事。",
