  "Purify and refresh in our traditional Thai herbal steam sanctuary — a deeply rooted practice using medicinal botanicals sourced from our canal-side gardens. Steam combines with aromatic herbs to open the pores, ease tension, and stimulate the lymphatic system.": "在我们的传统泰式草本蒸汽疗愈室净化焕新——这一源远流长的养生之法，选用运河畔花园种植的药用植物。蒸汽与芳香草本交融，舒张毛孔、缓解紧绷、促进淋巴循环。",
