  "Royal Thai facial, luk pra kob compress, and aromatic oil rituals to achieve natural luminosity on your wedding day.": "泰式皇家面部护理、Luk Pra Kob 草本热敷与芳香精油仪式，让您在婚礼当天绽放自然光彩。",
