  "Vegetarian & Vegan": "素食与纯素",
  "Venue Options": "场地选择",
  "Vitality & Renewal": "活力与焕新",
  "W1 Bangkoknoi · Urban Wellness Retreat": "W1 Bangkoknoi · 都市疗愈度假村",
  "W1 Café invites you to immerse yourself in a captivating visual journey. Seated at the water's edge, our storytelling unfolds through breathtaking, timeless views of the historic Thai temple across the canal — a scene of rare beauty that shifts with the light, from the golden serenity of morning to the luminous glow of dusk. Whether you arrive by boat or by foot, linger over a perfectly brewed coffee or a handcrafted light bite, and let the temple view tell its ancient story.": "W1 Café 邀您沉浸于一场动人的视觉之旅。坐于水畔，故事在运河对岸历史悠久的泰式古寺的绝美永恒景致中徐徐展开——这幅罕见的美景随光线流转，从清晨的金色宁静到黄昏的璀璨光辉。无论乘船或步行而至，请在一杯完美冲煮的咖啡或一份手作轻食中流连，让寺庙景致为您讲述它古老的故事。",
  "Wake to views of the Bangkok Noi Canal from your Deluxe room. Available in King and Twin configurations, these generously appointed rooms blend contemporary comfort with authentic Thai design elements and canal-side serenity. Perfect for couples, friends, or families — an extra bed can be added on request.": "在豪华客房中醒来，曼谷诺依运河的景致映入眼帘。提供特大床与双床配置，宽敞雅致的客房将当代舒适与地道泰式设计元素及运河畔的宁静融为一体。适合情侣、好友或家庭——可应要求加床。",
  "Wat Takhian Floating Market Cruise": "Wat Takhian 水上市场游船之旅",
  "Watch Video": "观看视频",
  "We aim to keep information accurate and up to date, but we do not warrant that every detail on this site is complete or error-free. Links to third-party services (such as online booking engines or maps) are provided for convenience; their terms apply separately.": "我们力求信息准确且及时更新，但不保证本网站的每项细节均完整无误。指向第三方服务（如在线预订引擎或地图）的链接仅为方便而提供，其条款另行适用。",
  "We are carefully curating this experience. Further details will be announced in due course.": "我们正在精心打磨这一体验，更多详情将适时公布。",
  "We honour beautiful traditions with our three most popular ceremonial journeys, meticulously coordinated for an effortless celebration.": "我们以三大最受欢迎的仪式之旅致敬美好传统，精心统筹，让庆典轻松从容。",
  "We're here to help you plan the perfect stay. Whether you have a question, a special request, or simply want to learn more about life on the Bangkok Noi Canal — our team is ready.": "我们随时为您规划完美的入住体验。无论您有疑问、特别需求，或只是想进一步了解曼谷诺依运河畔的生活——我们的团队都已准备就绪。",
  "Weddings at W1 Bangkoknoi — where timeless elegance meets enchanting riverside charm. Intimate ceremonies to grand receptions for 50 to 200 guests.": "W1 Bangkoknoi 的婚礼——永恒优雅与迷人河畔风情在此交汇。从私密仪式到50至200位宾客的盛大婚宴。",
