  "Within 24 hours, your Navigator sends a personal reflection — your wellness notes, gentle rituals to carry the calm home, and a special returning guest offer.": "24小时内，您的健康领航师将送上一份专属回顾——您的疗愈笔记、可将宁静带回家中的温柔仪式，以及一份回访宾客专属礼遇。",
